layout: layouts/base.njk
tone: green
title: "Family guidebook"
description: "The Palm River Academy Family Guidebook: the short version of what every PRA family needs to know, and the full guidebook to read or download."
---

{% set heroPhoto = "gallery-reading-corner" %}
{% set heroEyebrow = "Families" %}
{% set heroTitle = 'The family <span class="mark">guidebook</span>' %}
{% set heroText = "Drop-off, pick-up, sick days, phones: what every PRA family needs to know." %}
{% include "partials/pagehero.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap two two--top">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Every family, every day</p>
      <h2>The short version</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li><strong>Doors open at 8:00.</strong> Classes run from 8:30 to 15:20. Nursery and Kindergarten finish at 15:15.</li>
        <li><strong>Off sick or away?</strong> Tell us by 8:00 that morning. For travel, give us seven days' notice so the teachers can prepare work.</li>
        <li><strong>Pick-up</strong> is only by the people named on your enrollment form.</li>
        <li><strong>Pack</strong> a water bottle every day, and closed-toe shoes for PE and trips. Early Years: spare clothes, plus nappies and wipes if needed.</li>
        <li><strong>No uniform.</strong> Children come in their own clothes.</li>
        <li><strong>Phones</strong> stay at the front desk until the end of the day.</li>
        <li><strong>Signs of illness</strong> such as fever, cough, rash, red eyes, vomiting or diarrhoea: tell us straight away.</li>
        <li><strong>News</strong> comes through Google Classroom, the weekly newsletter and your class Zalo group.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    {# The guidebook is a Canva PDF from the office (Family Guidebook 2026.pdf), saved smaller for phones.
       Each line under "Inside" opens it at that page, in browsers that follow #page. #}
    <div class="card guidebook">
      <a class="guidebook__cover" href="{{ '/assets/docs/family-guidebook-2026.pdf' | href(lang) }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% photo "family-guidebook-2026-cover", "", "(min-width: 480px) 150px, 124px" %}</a>
      <div>
        <h3>Family Guidebook 2026</h3>
        <p>Everything else is in the guidebook: joining PRA, fees, health and first aid, the bus, after-school activities, devices, and how to reach us.</p>
        <p class="guidebook__meta">12 pages · PDF · 3.3 MB</p>
        <p class="guidebook__do">
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--small" href="{{ '/assets/docs/family-guidebook-2026.pdf' | href(lang) }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the guidebook</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" href="{{ '/assets/docs/family-guidebook-2026.pdf' | href(lang) }}" download="Palm River Academy Family Guidebook 2026.pdf">Download</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="guidebook__inside">
        <p class="guidebook__head">Inside</p>
        <ol>
          {% for p in [
            [2, "Welcome to Palm River Academy"], [3, "Our mission and vision"], [4, "Your role in our partnership"],
            [5, "Key policies you should know"], [6, "Joining us at Palm River"], [7, "Daily life at PRA"],
            [8, "Learning at PRA"], [9, "Health, safety and well-being"], [10, "Community expectations"],
            [11, "Family partnership"], [12, "Contact information"]
          ] %}
          <li><a href="{{ '/assets/docs/family-guidebook-2026.pdf' | href(lang) }}#page={{ p[0] }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>p. {{ p[0] }}</span>{{ p[1] }}</a></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set ctaTitle = "Ask the office about anything else." %}
{% set ctaText = "If it is a good question, we will add it to the guidebook." %}
